Derived files:

  - src/pack/gguf.rs
    GGUF block formats Q4_0, Q4_1, Q5_0, Q5_1 and Q8_0.

  - src/pack/kquant.rs
    K-quant super-block formats Q2_K, Q3_K, Q4_K, Q5_K, Q6_K and Q8_K.

  - src/pack/tq.rs
    Ternary formats TQ1_0 and TQ2_0.

  - src/pack/iq.rs
    IQ4_NL and IQ4_XS codebook formats.

  - src/pack/iq1.rs
    IQ1_S and IQ1_M codebook formats.

  - src/pack/iq_codebook.rs
    IQ2_XXS, IQ2_XS, IQ3_XXS and IQ3_S codebook formats.

  - src/pack/iq_grids.rs
    Grid and sign lookup tables shared by the IQ formats.

The remaining source files are original NeuroLib code.
